<h3 data-start=3D"1759" data-end=3D"1776">What changes:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1777" data-end=3D"1935">
<li data-start=3D"1777" data-end=3D"1887">
<p data-start=3D"1779" data-end=3D"1887">The <code data-start=3D"1783" data=
-end=3D"1788">#ID</code> column now starts at <code data-start=3D"1810" dat=
a-end=3D"1813">1</code> and increments with each row (<code data-start=3D"1=
844" data-end=3D"1858">1, 2, 3, ...</code>) regardless of database IDs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1888" data-end=3D"1935">
<p data-start=3D"1890" data-end=3D"1935">It <strong data-start=3D"1893" dat=
a-end=3D"1908">resets to 1</strong> every time the page loads.</p>
</li>
</ul>
